mapping "V1700.1" source="V1700" target="48084008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V1700 = Swedish extension of WHO V17.0 SNOMED CT 242146008 47397001 48084008, with activity
        suffix. The activity suffix is a non-clinical Swedish annotation; underlying injury = V17.0.
        Targets are the standard concepts V17.0 maps to per Athena crosswalk: 432510 (Driver in
        vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, 48084008), 433099 (Victim, cyclist in vehicular AND/OR
